  "query_preview": "../ Sunday to Friday / Sunday continues to look like it\nwill be part of the break between weather systems tracking over\nthe gulf and into Panhandle and Canada. The system early Sunday\nwill into the British Columbia south of the Panhandle. The issue \nthe right is that the low to roll in on Monday is appearing to be \na significant low into the lower 960s. Strong winds the will \nlikely be Storm force and possibly High wind or wind advisories \nfor a portion of the southern and central panhandle. Also since \nthe low will be pulling out of the central Pacific, so expect that\nthere will be some moderate to heavy rainfalls But Will probably\nnot have any flooding issues with the Monday system WInds and\nrains to increase then improve through Tuesday.",
